he meat is not cooked"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l036","ordinal":271519,"en":"It's hard to see"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l037","ordinal":271520,"en":"Busy, people are tired,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l038","ordinal":271521,"en":"A child of the pot"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l039","ordinal":271522,"en":"Twelve days old."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l001","ordinal":271523,"en":"For twelve days the meat would not cook—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l002","ordinal":271524,"en":"Such a dire calamity had befallen them."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l003","ordinal":271525,"en":"Here and there the cauldron’s"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l004","ordinal":271526,"en":"Middle heaved and bulged;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l005","ordinal":271527,"en":"The rim and sides of the cauldron"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l006","ordinal":271528,"en":"Quivered almost imperceptibly;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l007","ordinal":271529,"en":"Along the cauldron’s outer edge"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l008","ordinal":271530,"en":"Blood-red foam surged and seethed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l009","ordinal":271531,"en":"Külchoro, finest of heroes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l010","ordinal":271532,"en":"Was distraught, finding no remedy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l011","ordinal":271533,"en":"Twisting this way and that,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l012","ordinal":271534,"en":"Despairing, “We are doomed!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l013","ordinal":271535,"en":"Unable to find a way, Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l014","ordinal":271536,"en":"Went to his elder kinsman:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l015","ordinal":271537,"en":"“My guide upon the righteous path,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l016","ordinal":271538,"en":"My uncle, sultan of countless hosts,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l017","ordinal":271539,"en":"My ocean spring, my broad river,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l018","ordinal":271540,"en":"My steadfast khan and uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l019","ordinal":271541,"en":"Will you never have your fill of sleep?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l020","ordinal":271542,"en":"Will your hip not tire of lying there?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l021","ordinal":271543,"en":"There is no sentry posted on the tower—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l022","ordinal":271544,"en":"Wake from your sleep, uncle!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l023","ordinal":271545,"en":"Your former vigor is gone;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l024","ordinal":271546,"en":"Do not sleep on without cause."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l025","ordinal":271547,"en":"There is no end to your strange behavior:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l026","ordinal":271548,"en":"The broth will not boil, the meat will not cook;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l027","ordinal":271549,"en":"A day of dreadful trouble has come—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l028","ordinal":271550,"en":"What can this mean?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l029","ordinal":271551,"en":"O roaring leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l030","ordinal":271552,"en":"How do you interpret this omen?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l031","ordinal":271553,"en":"The offering boils, yet the meat will not cook—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l032","ordinal":271554,"en":"How can such a thing be?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l033","ordinal":271555,"en":"Interpret this sign for me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l034","ordinal":271556,"en":"From some long-eared elder,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l035","ordinal":271557,"en":"Have you ever heard of such a thing?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l036","ordinal":271558,"en":"From all the attentive people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l037","ordinal":271559,"en":"From one who has worn his horse’s shoulders thin,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l038","ordinal":271560,"en":"Grown old among nations and seen many peoples,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l039","ordinal":271561,"en":"And journeyed around all four quarters"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l001","ordinal":271562,"en":"Of the dark earth with its hairy breast—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l002","ordinal":271563,"en":"From my aged forefather Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l003","ordinal":271564,"en":"Have you ever heard of such a deed?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l004","ordinal":271565,"en":"We kindled a fire as great as Opol-Too,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l005","ordinal":271566,"en":"And fed it with bent plane-tree logs;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l006","ordinal":271567,"en":"Beneath the brimming cauldron"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l007","ordinal":271568,"en":"We made a fire fierce as hell,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l008","ordinal":271569,"en":"Yet the cauldron never boiled,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l009","ordinal":271570,"en":"And even now your feast is uncooked."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l010","ordinal":271571,"en":"Is this what you are, wretched world?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l011","ordinal":271572,"en":"Alas, uncle, arise!” he cried."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l012","ordinal":271573,"en":"Having spoken these words, Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l013","ordinal":271574,"en":"Awakened the heroic sultan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l014","ordinal":271575,"en":"He woke with a start from sleep,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l015","ordinal":271576,"en":"His snoring ceased,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l016","ordinal":271577,"en":"And that noble lion, proud as a cock,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l017","ordinal":271578,"en":"Opened his eyes wide as bowls"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l018","ordinal":271579,"en":"And said this to Külchoro:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l019","ordinal":271580,"en":"“That your feast will not cook"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l020","ordinal":271581,"en":"Means your strength is about to fail;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l021","ordinal":271582,"en":"It means that from the noble uncle"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l022","ordinal":271583,"en":"Whom you honored as a father—from that gray wolf—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l023","ordinal":271584,"en":"You, my warrior, are about to be parted!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l024","ordinal":271585,"en":"When broth will not boil and meat will not cook,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l025","ordinal":271586,"en":"No human undertaking can prosper!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l026","ordinal":271587,"en":"Thus spoke Semetey:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l027","ordinal":271588,"en":"“As for this food that will not cook,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l028","ordinal":271589,"en":"Let wolves divide it and dogs feast on it;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l029","ordinal":271590,"en":"Let the dogs devour your feast!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l030","ordinal":271591,"en":"Then the bloodthirsty lion cried in anger:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l031","ordinal":271592,"en":"“The feast you prepared with such honor—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l032","ordinal":271593,"en":"Today Almighty God"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l033","ordinal":271594,"en":"Has bowed my head to the ground.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l034","ordinal":271595,"en":"So spoke Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l035","ordinal":271596,"en":"Seizing the cauldron and swinging it around,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l036","ordinal":271597,"en":"He sent it clanging"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l037","ordinal":271598,"en":"Off to the side."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l038","ordinal":271599,"en":"The cauldron broke into six pieces,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l001","ordinal":271600,"en":"And all the food inside spilled out;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l002","ordinal":271601,"en":"Thus was the sorrow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l003","ordinal":271602,"en":"Of the leopard-hearted gray wolf revealed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l004","ordinal":271603,"en":"He had discerned the true meaning,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l005","ordinal":271604,"en":"And the cauldron possessed by the enemy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l006","ordinal":271605,"en":"He had cleaved into seven pieces."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l007","ordinal":271606,"en":"The lion who yearned for his worthy kinsmen"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l008","ordinal":271607,"en":"Came up and looked;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l009","ordinal":271608,"en":"As he prayed for the people’s safety,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l010","ordinal":271609,"en":"Kanchoro, who had been on guard,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l011","ordinal":271610,"en":"Came running, shouting,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l012","ordinal":271611,"en":"“Prepare yourselves—the enemy is coming!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l013","ordinal":271612,"en":"He summoned the two heroes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l014","ordinal":271613,"en":"The camel-hide war drum—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l015","ordinal":271614,"en":"Flee far away when you hear its voice—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l016","ordinal":271615,"en":"At the command,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1104:b003:l017","ordinal":271616,"en":"The champion beats it in haste,"}]
